<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ICI raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ICI raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Wednesday it had raised its near-term rating for Britain's Imperial Chemical Industries Plc, or ICI, to accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept its long-term neutral rating for the company.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts opened up 2-1/2 at 49-3/4.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
